sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as TUI / app client
    participant Service as SkillsService
    participant Catalog as Skills extension/providers
    participant Turn as Turn context
    participant Model as Model
    participant SkillTool as skills.list/read
    participant Resource as SKILL.md/resource

    Client->>Service: discover roots + load snapshot
    Service-->>Catalog: metadata, errors, authority handles
    Catalog->>Turn: render catalog metadata under budget
    alt explicit user mention
        Client->>Turn: UserInput::Skill or $skill mention
        Turn->>Catalog: resolve selected entry
        Catalog->>Resource: read through provider authority
        Resource-->>Turn: skill instructions
    else implicit command attribution
        Turn->>Turn: inspect script/SKILL.md command path
        Turn-->>Catalog: emit deduplicated implicit invocation
    else model skill tools
        Model->>SkillTool: skills.list(authority)
        SkillTool-->>Model: bounded opaque handles
        Model->>SkillTool: skills.read(authority, package, resource)
        SkillTool->>Resource: provider-authorized read
        Resource-->>SkillTool: structured content
        SkillTool-->>Model: external JSON result
    end
    Turn->>Model: selected instructions + tool result
